msgid "浦东新区科技和经济委员会"
msgstr "浦东新区科技和经济委员会"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:6
msgid "Government | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "政府部门｜浦东新区｜资料核查日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:8
msgid ""
"2026 AI application call closed on 31 August 2026. The published route "
"covers qualifying 2025 model and agent expenditure; duplicate public "
"funding is excluded."
msgstr "2026年人工智能应用项目申报已于2026年8月31日截止。该通知面向符合条件的2025年模型与智能体支出，已获其他财政资金资助的项目不得重复申报。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S099 "
"<https://www.pudong.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj-zcxwj/2026/225/358644.html>`_. "
"关于开展2026年度浦东新区促进人工智能产业高质量发展专项（大模型等AI新技术应用项目） 申报工作的通知_政策性文件."
msgstr "`资料来源 S099 <https://www.pudong.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj-zcxwj/2026/225/358644.html>`_. 关于开展2026年度浦东新区促进人工智能产业高质量发展专项（大模型等AI新技术应用项目） 申报工作的通知_政策性文件."

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "项目状态与支持内容"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构信息已核实，当前是否接受申请需确认"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "尚未确认统一的现金资助额度、费用减免或股权比例，请向运营机构索取最新书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系方式与地址"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:22
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.pudong.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网及申请渠道 <https://www.pudong.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:24
msgid "Telephone: +86 21 68811090."
msgstr "电话：+86 21 68811090。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图采用行政区或校区参考点，不代表已核实的办公地址。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "以下步骤为本书整理的申请参考，实际办理流程以最新官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:33
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读有明确发布日期的通知，确认属地、申请主体、业务及费用发生期间等条件。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "按清单准备材料，并按要求取得依托单位或区级部门推荐。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:37
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止时间前通过官方平台提交，保存受理回执。"

#: ../../entities/government-pudong.rst:39
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "按通知要求完成评审、立项、报告、验收及资金拨付手续。"

